User Routes

Authentication required for:
	•	GET /api/v1/user/:id – users can access only their own data
	•	PUT /api/v1/user/:id – users can update only their own data
	•	DELETE /api/v1/user/:id – users can delete only their own account

Cat Routes

Authentication required for:
	•	PUT /api/v1/cat/:id – only the owner of the cat can update it
	•	DELETE /api/v1/cat/:id – only the owner of the cat can delete it

Auth Routes
	•	GET /api/v1/auth/me – requires a valid token
